6
00:00:19,769 --> 00:00:22,609
(Sheldon:)We stayed
for the California Adventure water show.

7
00:00:22,772 --> 00:00:25,692
(Sheldon:)It was pure Disney magic.

8
00:00:26,192 --> 00:00:28,982
-I was gonna see that with him.
-How was I to know that?

9
00:00:29,195 --> 00:00:31,485
(Sheldon:)It's all right. I'll see it again with you.

10
00:00:31,697 --> 00:00:33,487
I have food here. You were gonna call.

11
00:00:33,699 --> 00:00:35,949
(Penny:)-I know, I know.
-I can still eat.

12
00:00:36,118 --> 00:00:39,578
(Penny:)No. You already threw up once.
Go put on your p.j.'s and brush your teeth.

13
00:00:41,707 --> 00:00:43,417
(Sheldon:)Okay, but just don't fight.

14
00:00:43,584 --> 00:00:45,334
(Leonard:)-We're not fighting.
-Just go.

15
00:00:48,589 --> 00:00:50,759
Aren't you gonna thank Penny
for taking you?

16
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:53,465
(Sheldon:)Thank you, Penny.

17
00:00:54,595 --> 00:00:56,385
(Penny:)You're welcome, sweetie.

18
00:00:57,431 --> 00:00:59,021
(Leonard:)Want a cup of coffee?

